+++ b/releasenotes/notes/before-sleep-metrics-3f1c9a7b2d4e6a80.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    Added ``before_sleep_metrics(client, name)``, which calls
+    ``client.incr(f"{name}.retry")`` before each sleep.
+fixes:
+  - |
+    ``before_log``, ``after_log``, ``before_sleep_log`` and
+    ``before_sleep_metrics`` no longer let exceptions raised by the logger or
+    metrics client propagate into the retry loop. They are logged at debug
+    level on the ``tenacity`` logger and ignored.
