+++ b/releasenotes/notes/stats-hook-5b8e2c41a7d93f06.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    Added a ``stats_hook`` option to ``Retrying``, ``AsyncRetrying`` and
+    ``@retry``. When set, it is called with a copy of the statistics dict
+    after every attempt, including the last one (successful or not). Errors
+    raised by the hook are logged at debug level on the ``tenacity`` logger
+    and ignored.
